    // PVE-exclusive Arena task chain ("[PVE ZONE]" suffix)
    //
    // These tasks only exist in the PVE game mode (json.tarkov.dev/pve/tasks);
    // they have no id in the regular bundle at all. The German bundle left
    // both the task names and several objective descriptions in plain
    // English. The "[PVE ZONE]" suffix is kept in every translated name:
    // BSG's own German localization drops the suffix entirely, which would
    // make the PVE and PVP variants of these tasks display identically and
    // become indistinguishable in the tracker.
    //
    // 16 of the 21 names below have an attested PVP-mode twin (same name
    // minus "[PVE ZONE]" replaced by "[PVP ZONE]"); those names are copied
    // verbatim from the PVP twin's translated German name, including
    // whichever hyphen variant that bundle already uses. The remaining 5
    // (both "Professional Fitness" parts, "Arena Business", "Hold the
    // Lead", and "To Great Heights! - Part 6") have no translated twin
    // anywhere in the bundle; "To Great Heights! - Part 6" is derived from
    // the "Teil 1"-"Teil 5" naming already used by its own chain, the other
    // 4 are original translations.
    //
    // Proof: https://json.tarkov.dev/pve/tasks_de

    // Easy Money - Part 1 / Leicht verdientes Geld - Teil 1
    // Name twin: 66058cb22cee99303f1ba067 ("Easy Money - Part 1 [PVP ZONE]").
    // The single objective is left in stale English by the bundle, and it
    // is stale in two ways, not just untranslated: its English text
    // duplicates the PVP twin task's objective (6606b709f7ce34bb26221cab),
    // whose German bundle entry exists but is itself broken. It reads
    // "Platziere die „Bison VS Undertaker"-Plakate in den Wohnquartiere der
    // Scavbasis in Customs" - a grammatically wrong dative plural ("den
    // Wohnquartiere" needs the "-n": "Wohnquartieren"), naming an old poster
    // ("Bison VS Undertaker", plural) that BSG has since swapped for a
    // different, singular one. The current English text for this PVE task
    // confirms the swap: "the Arena advertisement poster" (singular). This
    // translation follows the current English content and reuses the PVP
    // twin's established structure and terms ("Platziere ...", "Scavbasis",
    // "in Customs") while fixing the grammar and the item name.
    // Proof: https://json.tarkov.dev/pve/tasks_de (6834145ebc1f443d7603c8a7)
    '6834145ebc1f443d7603c8a7': {
      // Was: Easy Money - Part 1 [PVE ZONE]
      name: 'Leicht verdientes Geld - Teil 1 [PVE ZONE]',
      objectives: {
        // Was: Plant the Arena advertisement poster in the living quarters at the Scav base on Customs
        '6834145ebc1f443d7603c8ab': {
          description: 'Platziere das Arena-Werbeplakat in den Wohnquartieren der Scavbasis in Customs',
        },
      },
    },

